  "summary": "Toyota Motor Corporation (TMC) today assigned members of the board of directors at its Ordinary General Shareholders' Meeting, and appointed representative directors and directors with special titles at a subsequent Board meeting. On the same day, TMC announced its executive appointments following the Ordinary General Shareholders' Meeting.",
